# Expectations every profile carries (read by xnw smoke).
# #fail <regex>: any matching line fails the run. #expect <s> <regex>: must
# appear by log second <s>. Regex: Python's subset (see apps/xnw/src/smoke.rs).
#fail WARN  EXCEPTION 0x
#fail UNIMPLEMENTED \S+!
#fail run ended at the first unimplemented
#fail panicked at
#fail [Dd]evice removed
#fail XErrorReport\(
#fail d3d12x: no host device
#fail is in no game drive folder
# a switch value we did not understand (a mistyped watch file reads as items)
#fail watch: skipped item
#fail XNW_PATCH: no patch named
#fail WARN  XNW_[A-Z_]+=\S*: not
#fail XNW_MESH: unknown item
# a mode that silently stops another: a profile states each mode's own line with #expect
#expect 10 PresentX frame 1 \(
